# Sandbox-ai agent fence — pf anchor rules for the dedicated agent user.
# Loaded into anchor "com.sandboxai/agent" by agent-fence.sh. @AGENT_USER@ is substituted.
#
# The agent may talk only to loopback, where the Sandbox-ai proxy listens. The proxy decides by
# hostname and writes receipts. Everything else the agent sends is dropped and logged.

pass out quick on lo0 user @AGENT_USER@
pass in  quick on lo0 user @AGENT_USER@
block out log quick user @AGENT_USER@
block in  log quick user @AGENT_USER@
